        "original_id": "f1e00d7c-ef9f-5026-afaf-b9e8f1b38507",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Owen Wister, Lucy Maud Montgomery, L.M. Montgomery\n- Roles: writer, historian, author\n- Works: western fiction, Anne of Green Gables\n- Topics: American literature, Canadian literature\n\nFacts:\n- Owen Wister was born on July 14, 1860, and he was an American writer and historian.\n- Owen Wister was known as the \"father\" of western fiction.\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery was born on November 30, 1874, and she was a Canadian author who published as L.M. Montgomery.\n- In 1908, Lucy Maud Montgomery began a series of novels with Anne of Green Gables.\n- Lucy Maud Montgomery died on April 24, 1942.\n- Owen Wister died on July 21, 1938.",
